        "user_title": "Chief Justice",
        "title_is_group": false,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Hey everyone!!!</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I wanted to let you all know that, if you are attending Gen Con, you should definitely sign up for the event \"Terror in Megalopolis\". It is a Sentinel Comics LARP co-written by Chrisopher and Adam (who will be there!) and&nbsp;Phoenix Outlaw Productions, who will also be running the event. It is a brand-new system and story and it is going to be *amazing*. We are running 2, each of which has a limit of 35 players. The first will be on Saturday evening at 8pm, and the second will be on Sunday morning at 11am.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I'm posting about it here not only because it will be amazing and I wanted to make sure all of you know, but also because it wasn't live when Gen Con tickets went on sale, so we have a lot of slots left! I also wanted to explain what \"Terror in Megalopolis\" means, since Gen Con prevented us from using a more logical and useful title like \"Sentinel Comics LARP\".</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Anyhow, if you'll be at Gen Con, definitely sign up! It's worth it!</p>",
